DESCRIPTION:One of the raunchiest nights of the month at Notsuoh! A night o
	f themed dirty\, nerdy\, flirty burlesque performance from the ladies of T
	entacle Temptation Productions— inclusive\, body positive and sexyAF! A ho
	t mess of booty shaking and titty twirling with NO COVER CHARGE — just buy
	 a drink to get upstairs and bring a thick stack of ones to throw at the p
	erformers\, they will reward you for your effort$!\n\nhttps://www.notsuoh.
	com/events/iom4uvj4agxwp8but13ne3jx7kjvu0-y6cht
